      "writtenOn": "2022-06-17T19:30:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why does this even need to be in 50mW increments? What are the odds of finding a charger that is 14.05 W? I think just Watts would be enough here and would also mean it could fit in 8 bits, saving a bit of precious EC ACPI memory mapped space.",
